    {"problem": "Your furnace is over 15 years old", "solution": "Gas furnaces last 15 to 20 years in Ontario. Past that, parts get scarce, efficiency drops and the heat exchanger is a growing risk. A new 96% AFUE unit uses far less gas for the same heat."},
